								<Comment Bounds="734 395 300 190" Id="2386" SizeToText="False" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
									<p.Text>"To add new TestStand controls to the UI:\r\n1. Add a new TestStand Control on the front panel from the TestStand Palette \r\n2. Modify the TestStand UI Data Type definition to include a reference to this control\r\n3. Expand the Bundle by Name structure and wire the TestStand control terminal to the new element terminal\r\n4. Connect the new control to a manager control in the subVIs within the configure connections state."</p.Text>
								</Comment>
								<Comment Bounds="4 650 630 15" Id="2388" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
									<p.Text>Store references to the UI controls for later use. Also, set the TestStand main application window to be this VI</p.Text>
								</Comment>
