								<Comment Bounds="24 635 640 15" Id="2389" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
									<p.Text>Configure the Connections and Commands for the Application, SequenceFileView, and ExecutionView Managers.</p.Text>
								</Comment>
								<Comment Bounds="634 275 330 175" Id="2395" SizeToText="False" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
									<p.Text>"Any new TestStand controls you create must be connected to a manager control in order to function.  Follow the steps in the Initialize state to add a reference to your controls to the UI Data cluster.  You can then call a connection method in one of the VIs in this case.  \r\n\r\nChoose the manager control and connection method based on the desired functionality of the control. Refer to the Connecting Manager Controls to Visible Controls Topic in the TestStand help for details on the Manager controls and available connection methods.\r\n"</p.Text>
								</Comment>
								<Literal Bounds="954 230 45 15" DataType="@14c93059f4124f01ac75d6970ef23ad7" Id="2768" Label="2989" p9:ControlDefinitionChecksum="MWFqRNArChmP7fZV0w9PmuyUZHiA59YHkBNoO+qQjmA=" xmlns:p9="http://www.ni.com/PanelCommon" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
									<p.Data>2</p.Data>
